                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much do regional festivals drive for regional-focused D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>20-35% of annual regional revenue for regional-focused brands. Combined with major festivals significant regional D2C driver.</p>
                                        <h3>Should national brands do regional festivals?</h3>
                                        <p>For brands with regional presence: yes with regional-specific creative + language + content. 5-15% of annual budget.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest regional festival D2C mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Hindi-only content + no regional adaptation. Regional festivals require regional-language + cultural + creator adaptation.</p>
                                        <h3>Are regional festivals viable revenue driver?</h3>
                                        <p>For regional-focused + diaspora + specialty brands: yes. Combined with major festivals significant D2C driver.</p>
